{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "Candidate node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be has no executable meaning available. Its typed question cannot establish executable correspondence; the unsupported '+' diagnostic does not establish which substantive rules were omitted or contradicted.",
    "Footnote 7 places the holistic discretionary assessment in cases below 50% of NAV. Candidate node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42 uses an operative designation as an input rather than implementing that assessment. Its disjunction does not itself confer designation power or make the listed factors automatic triggers.",
    "Candidate node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42 delegates exposure measurement, LAF identification and operative designation to supplied judgments. The formula alone cannot establish those facts or the completeness of indirect-exposure coverage.",
    "The supplied dependency IDs have no identifying metadata or non-null source hashes. No particular missing authority can safely be mapped to those IDs.",
    "Neither question resolves persistence after an exposure decline. The source supplies no declassification rule, and a negative contemporaneous route result must not be used as one.",
    "The runtime rule blocking evaluation for conflicts anywhere in the dependency closure is an implementation policy, not a requirement stated in the circular."
  ],
